MKDIR(1)                       User Commands                        MKDIR(1)

NAME
    mkdir - create a directory

SYNOPSIS
    mkdir NAME

DESCRIPTION
    Create a directory called NAME in the working directory. NAME is one
    name, not a path: change to the parent with cd(1) first.

    The new directory is owned by your login. Creating it needs the right
    to create entries in the working directory.

SEE ALSO
    rm(1), cd(1), ls(1)
